    examples: ["正文：Hart (2012, p. 94) argues...", "正文：规则的有效性依赖承认规则（Hart, 2012, p. 94）。", "参考文献：Hart, H.L.A. (2012) The Concept of Law. 3rd edn. Oxford: Oxford University Press."]
